<description>&lt;p&gt;President De la Espriella announced that two key leaders of the National Liberation Army were killed in recent operations. In Cauca, a strike killed ten ELN fighters and a separate incident killed ten ELN rebels, while a drone attack in Guapi killed one Marine and wounded four soldiers. A car bomb at the Casanare toll booths injured four women, and a Colombian rapper stomped on an Israeli flag during a performance. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQNlNyOFVrdklnWndIRUw2TEkxOHdjR2c0ZlF0VWZkUDZjT21RQk1xTGltdHZOcThnTy1aOVJhWmNaVVdWMGkwTUJNN1Q4Q1l2eDB5b2tTWjZ2RjFmdkQ1dDQ3Q3V5WXZaMzc5OE9ZZEVHT185NmZCSjJrSkZEMkhVLUJET05kV3Jtak9pa2lCamY0ekhzZlQxQzltUlM0VGZ1WDFLVi03QUpsWnpCSHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxPZlNzNUVOUHAyRWszSFZIUVd3cnhSalNPVGFIRUZhYUc1c1JldTRFYWRJSy05Z0ZEeEk0MjlxZ0o3Z3FVRTRtTnB5dzl5VE1NTXpUY2FVajRsRTJCOWpnZ052SXczN1E4c0JRZS1lcmZCR3hydXpJSEFqTjlqSkp0bTVqcXc1UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOY3k4cHo0TV9FUUFleHZFQUVHTkZZUDZ5STZqbm1VMW1kdlRtcVI3bjlvcjVTWVlKblo4N1JlTlNuTXlBWjVNWUV3eHM3ejc3c2xERzFadnFFRFBLbnZvWUxXNy15TVkta25ONTVzaHp3N2hhTHdld2x3bFVtUWNiZjd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;World Israel News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;World Israel News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNYm1IREhMVjNYczVEVkgzT0JPSzg5UVRoWW9lTzZkV2x1QXV5TUl2WWI3LUVVSjlfbVpRMFo2SU52RXpSSXRxRHJNMHA3OGl2Z3JTZi1BMW1DQ0MyUy00a0JZdzhHRXF0MS0yOTBkZndnc01YdF83VzlpNzhDOENvSWE5UnJOOXFXVEV6VlBzTzRkZk9YRWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&qu